    "text": "Four identical capacitors are connected with a battery of voltage <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext></math> and two switches <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;as shown in the figure below. Initially, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is closed, now if <math><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is also closed,&nbsp;find the heat loss.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/qwerr.jpg\" style=\"width: 134px; height: 104px;\" />",
